{{wikipedia}}

===Alternative forms===
* || (aka [[Unsupported titles/Vertical line|vertical bar]])

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ˈæb.səˌlut ˈvæl.ju/|/ˌæb.səˈljut ˈvæl.ju/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[absolute]] [[value]]}}

# {{context|mathematics|lang=en}} For a [[real number]], its [[numerical]] value without [[regard]] to its [[sign]]; formally, -1 times the number if the number is negative, and the number unmodified if it is zero or positive; the distance of a quantity from zero on a [[number line]].
# {{context|mathematics|lang=en}} For a [[complex number]], the [[square root]] of the [[sum]] of the [[square]]s of its [[real]] and [[imaginary]] parts.

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|square root}} [[modulus]].

